      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<section class=\"hero-template\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n  <div class=\"hero-template__content\">\n    <p class=\"hero-template__eyebrow\">AI 驱动的下一代工作平台</p>\n    <h1 id=\"hero-title\">让复杂工作，变得简单高效</h1>\n    <p class=\"hero-template__lead\">连接团队、数据与智能工具，在一个清晰的空间里把想法变成成果。</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-template__actions\">\n      <a class=\"hero-template__primary\" href=\"#start\">免费开始</a>\n      <a class=\"hero-template__secondary\" href=\"#demo\">观看演示</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.hero-template {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  display: grid;\n  min-height: 560px;\n  place-items: center;\n  padding: 72px 24px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, #818cf8 0, transparent 32%), linear-gradient(135deg, #111827, #312e81 55%, #6d28d9);\n  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.hero-template__content { max-width: 820px; }\n.hero-template__eyebrow { margin: 0 0 18px; color: #c7d2fe; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; }\n.hero-template h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 8vw, 5.5rem); line-height: 1.02; }\n.hero-template__lead { max-width: 660px; margin: 24px auto 0; color: #e0e7ff; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem); line-height: 1.7; }\n.hero-template__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 34px; }\n.hero-template__actions a { min-height: 44px; padding: 13px 24px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }\n.hero-template__primary { color: #312e81; background: #ffffff; }\n.hero-template__secondary { color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .55); }\n.hero-template a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #fde68a; outline-offset: 4px; }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .hero-template__actions a { scroll-behavior: auto; } }\n</style>\n"
    }
